by dylan-rumble at 2026-09-28T09:09:11Z

Temporary workaround for Api Platform users:
```yaml
# services.yaml
services:
    # Replaces API Platform's pass-through decorator of the object mapper. It registers itself as the
    # inner mapper's `objectMapper`, which makes Symfony initialize nested lazy ghosts via
    # `map($source, $ghost)` - mapping into an existing object, so the target constructor (and defaults
    # such as `new UuidV7()`) never runs. Undecorated, Symfony takes its own constructing path.
    api_platform.object_mapper.relation: '@object_mapper'
```

